            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>
                    To Sextus Tettius Montanus Caesius Sabinus, son of Sextus, of tribe Pupinia, [holder of] the public horse, aedile, pontifex, flamen of Trajan,
                    patron of the municipium, the urban plebs [dedicated this]. [Sextus], having accepted the honour, remitted the expense.  
                </p>
